memory_wrapper.c is a part of snd-page-alloc module and always built
when PCM is selected.  This means that usb-audio also must enable the
compilation of memory_wrapper.c.

My rough guess was that configure script failed to detect the
strlcpy, but I'm not sure now.  Anyway check include/config.h.


